"title=\"Don't Let Abliteration Abliterate Your Bug Hunting: Discovering Verdict Bias in Uncensored Models | clearbluejar\" description='Abliterated models never refuse, which makes them tempting for bug hunting. But on the same kernel source, they graduate three to four times as many findings to VALID, including false positives the base correctly rejects, and across a 28-file scan of FreeBSD’s sys/rpc the most aggressive build never surfaced the real CVE at all.' url='https://clearbluejar.github.io/posts/does-abliteration-skew-your-bug-hunting/' language='en' keywords=None robots=None og_title='Don’t Let Abliteration Abliterate Your Bug Hunting: Discovering Verdict Bias in Uncensored Models' og_description='Abliterated models never refuse, which makes them tempting for bug hunting. But on the same kernel source, they graduate three to four times as many findings to VALID, including false positives the base correctly rejects, and across a 28-file scan of FreeBSD’s sys/rpc the most aggressive build never surfaced the real CVE at all.' og_url='https://clearbluejar.github.io/posts/does-abliteration-skew-your-bug-hunting/' og_image='https://clearbluejar.github.io/assets/img/2026-09-01-does-abliteration-skew-your-bug-hunting/eyasu-etsub-_enXmoXudAk-unsplash.jpg' og_audio=None og_determiner=None og_locale='en' og_locale_alternate=None og_site_name='clearbluejar' og_video=None favicon='https://clearbluejar.github.io/assets/img/favicons/favicon-96x96.png' dc_terms_created=None dc_date_created=None dc_date=None dc_terms_type=None dc_type=None dc_terms_audience=None dc_terms_subject=None dc_subject=None dc_description=None dc_terms_keywords=None modified_time='2026-09-01T04:53:44+00:00' published_time='2026-09-01T06:00:00+00:00' article_tag=None article_section=None source_url='https://clearbluejar.github.io/posts/does-abliteration-skew-your-bug-hunting/' status_code=200 scrape_id='01a12248-29f0-727b-95e7-ba50e90d032c' num_pages=None content_type='text/html; charset=utf-8' pr